#: config.cpp:69
msgid ""
"You <font color=\"red\"><b>don't have</b></font> super-user privileges. You "
"<font color=\"green\">can</font> still change your own preferences but you "
"<font color=\"red\"><b>can't</b></font> change set-uid options."
msgstr ""
" <font color=\"red\"><b>Non ten</b></font> priviléxios de super-usuário. Ainda "
"asi <font color=\"green\">pode</font> cambiar as suas preferéncias pero <font "
"color=\"red\"><b>non pode</b></font> cambiar as opzóns set-uid."

